    },
    {
      "section": "Release",
      "text": "```sh\nnpm run release            # add --dry-run to print the plan without touching anything\n```\n\nThe tool pushes `dev`, lands it on `main` (fast-forward when possible, otherwise a content snapshot), pushes `main` and the tag, then syncs `dev` back. Publishing uses npm OIDC trusted publishing — no `NPM_TOKEN` — and the workflow installs npm ≥ 11.5.1 before publishing."
